  "title": "Nicole C NDE 3437",
  "date": "1986",
  "content": "It was one week after my sixteenth birthday and I was at my boyfriend's apartment. He had given me a hot pink jacket for my birthday that he bought with my money. This was a sore issue with me. When we had begun to argue, I brought up the fact that he didn't have a job and bought me a present with my money. He became enraged and I refused to back down until he had grabbed the jacket off the floor by the armpit with one hand and the cuff with the other, he wrapped it around my throat and twisted the sleeve tight. I remember first being underneath him as he choked me. I was trying to communicate with him to stop. Then suddenly I was looking down at his back while he was hunched over me, still choking me. I first was confused at what was happening, then I became very frightened at the thought of being killed and then next thing I knew I was back on the ground in my body gasping for air. I sat upright and was very terrified that I had just died and was very close to being taken away from my family. It was after that day that I began having dreams of things that would happen in the future. I only dream of tragedies and find that this is not a 'gift' but rather a curse. Other things have happened because of or in coincidence of this experience that would be considered out of the ordinary. Things such as being visited at night by three beings that wanted to take me with them, having other dreams with the beings in them.",
